### MaterialSales — PHYSICAL DELETE (expects 200 OK; quantity returned to the lot)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002
@id = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/material-sales/{{id}}

### MaterialLots — PHYSICAL DELETE of a lot with sales (expects 409 Conflict)
@materialLotId = 1

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/material-lots/{{materialLotId}}
